  "notes": "FORMATION:\n{反|はん} (anti-, reverse) + {射|しゃ} (shoot, emit) → bouncing back\n\nVERB FORM:\n{反射|はんしゃ}する (to reflect)\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- {反射|はんしゃ}{光|こう} (reflected light)\n- {反射|はんしゃ}{鏡|きょう} (reflector)\n- {反射|はんしゃ}{神経|しんけい} (reflex nerve/quick reflexes)\n- {条件|じょうけん}{反射|はんしゃ} (conditioned reflex)\n\nEXPRESSION:\n{反射|はんしゃ}{的|てき}に (reflexively, instinctively)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {屈折|くっせつ} (refraction)\n- {吸収|きゅうしゅう} (absorption)",
